    {
      "tr": "`(r * xs[:, None]).sum(axis=0) / nk` ağırlıklı ortalama.",
      "en": "`(r * xs[:, None]).sum(axis=0) / nk` is the weighted mean."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Varyans: `(r * (xs[:, None] - mu) ** 2).sum(axis=0) / nk`.",
      "en": "Variance: `(r * (xs[:, None] - mu) ** 2).sum(axis=0) / nk`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef m_step(xs, resp):\n    xs, r = np.array(xs, dtype=float), np.array(resp, dtype=float)\n    nk = r.sum(axis=0)\n    w = nk / len(xs)\n    mu = (r * xs[:, None]).sum(axis=0) / nk\n    var = (r * (xs[:, None] - mu) ** 2).sum(axis=0) / nk\n    return w.round(3).tolist(), mu.round(3).tolist(), var.round(3).tolist()\n\nxs = [0.0, 1.0, 4.0, 5.0]\nresp = [[1.0, 0.0], [0.8, 0.2], [0.1, 0.9], [0.0, 1.0]]\nw, mu, var = m_step(xs, resp)\nprint(w)\nprint(mu)\nprint(var)\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef m_step(xs, resp):\n    xs, r = np.array(xs, dtype=float), np.array(resp, dtype=float)\n    nk = r.sum(axis=0)\n    w = nk / len(xs)\n    mu = (r * xs[:, None]).sum(axis=0) / nk\n    var = (r * (xs[:, None] - mu) ** 2).sum(axis=0) / nk\n    return w.round(3).tolist(), mu.round(3).tolist(), var.round(3).tolist()\n\nxs = [0.0, 1.0, 4.0, 5.0]\nresp = [[1.0, 0.0], [0.8, 0.2], [0.1, 0.9], [0.0, 1.0]]\nw, mu, var = m_step(xs, resp)\nprint(w)\nprint(mu)\nprint(var)\n```"
    }
